---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LanguageToggle from '../../components/LanguageToggle.astro';
import SocialLinks from '../../components/SocialLinks.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const slug = '2026-11-01-the-one-who-is-worthy';
const pageURL = new URL(`${base}${slug}/`, Astro.site ?? Astro.url).toString();
const cover = `${base}${slug}-cover.jpg`;
const qr = `${base}qr/${slug}.png`;
const sections = [
  {
    number: '01', title: 'Look beyond the symbols', filTitle: 'Tumingin lampas sa mga simbolo',
    paragraphs: [
      ['Revelation means an unveiling. After seeing the risen Christ and hearing his words to the seven churches, John is shown a vision of heaven. Revelation 4–5 invites us to see who reigns and who is worthy, even as the chapters ahead reveal what must take place.', 'Ang Revelation ay nangangahulugang paglalantad o pagpapahayag. Matapos makita ang muling nabuhay na Cristo at marinig ang Kanyang mensahe sa pitong iglesia, ipinakita kay Juan ang isang pangitain ng langit. Sa Pahayag 4–5, inaanyayahan tayong makita kung sino ang naghahari at kung sino ang karapat-dapat, habang inilalahad ng mga susunod na kabanata ang mga mangyayari.'],
      ['The visions contain striking images. Christians may differ in how they understand some details, so let us be careful not to miss the central message while arguing over symbols. The throne is occupied, and the Lamb is worthy. Let that truth lead us to faith and worship.', 'Maraming kahanga-hangang larawan sa mga pangitain. Maaaring magkakaiba ang pagkaunawa ng mga Kristiyano sa ilang detalye, kaya mag-ingat tayong huwag mawala ang pangunahing mensahe sa pagtatalo tungkol sa mga simbolo. May nakaupo sa trono, at karapat-dapat ang Kordero. Hayaan nating akayin tayo ng katotohanang ito sa pananampalataya at pagsamba.']
    ], question: ['What can we lose when we concentrate on disputed details but overlook the One at the center of the vision?', 'Ano ang maaari nating makaligtaan kapag nakatuon tayo sa pinagtatalunang detalye sa halip na sa nasa sentro ng pangitain?']
  },
  {
    number: '02', title: 'God is seated on the throne', filTitle: 'Ang Diyos ay nakaupo sa trono',
    paragraphs: [
      ['John sees a throne in heaven with One seated on it. The brilliant stones, rainbow, lightning, and thunder convey a scene of glory and power. The four living creatures continually declare the holiness of the Lord, and the twenty-four elders fall before him and lay down their crowns. They worship him because he created all things and all things exist by his will.', 'Nakita ni Juan ang isang trono sa langit at ang Isa na nakaupo rito. Ang maningning na mga bato, bahaghari, kidlat, at kulog ay nagpapakita ng kaluwalhatian at kapangyarihan. Walang tigil na ipinapahayag ng apat na nilalang ang kabanalan ng Panginoon, at nagpapatirapa ang dalawampu’t apat na matatanda at inilalagay ang kanilang mga putong sa harap Niya. Sinasamba nila Siya dahil nilikha Niya ang lahat at sa Kanyang kalooban umiiral ang lahat.'],
      ['We hear of conflict in the world and face uncertainty in our homes, health, and finances. These burdens are real. Yet God has not abandoned his throne. His power gives us reason to bring our fears to him and trust his rule, even when we cannot see how our circumstances will unfold.', 'Naririnig natin ang mga alitan sa mundo at humaharap tayo sa kawalan ng kasiguraduhan sa pamilya, kalusugan, at pananalapi. Totoo ang mga pasaning ito. Ngunit hindi iniwan ng Diyos ang Kanyang trono. Dahil sa Kanyang kapangyarihan, maaari nating dalhin sa Kanya ang ating takot at magtiwala sa Kanyang pamamahala kahit hindi natin alam ang mangyayari.']
    ], verse: ['Revelation 4:11', 'Our Lord and God is worthy of glory, honor, and power, for he created all things.', 'Karapat-dapat ang ating Panginoon at Diyos sa kaluwalhatian, karangalan, at kapangyarihan, sapagkat nilikha Niya ang lahat.'], question: ['What present concern do we need to bring before the God who reigns? How can remembering his holiness and power shape our response?', 'Anong alalahanin ngayon ang kailangan nating dalhin sa Diyos na naghahari? Paano huhubugin ng Kanyang kabanalan at kapangyarihan ang ating pagtugon?']
  },
  {
    number: '03', title: 'Who is worthy to open the scroll?', filTitle: 'Sino ang karapat-dapat magbukas ng balumbon?',
    paragraphs: [
      ['In the right hand of the One on the throne is a scroll sealed with seven seals. A mighty angel asks who is worthy to open it. No one in heaven, on earth, or under the earth can open it or look inside. John weeps. The scroll points us toward God’s unfolding purposes, including judgment and redemption; the question of who can open it matters.', 'Sa kanang kamay ng nakaupo sa trono ay may balumbon na may pitong selyo. Itinanong ng isang makapangyarihang anghel kung sino ang karapat-dapat magbukas nito. Walang sinuman sa langit, sa lupa, o sa ilalim ng lupa ang makapagbukas o makatingin sa loob nito. Umiyak si Juan. Itinuturo tayo ng balumbon sa mga layunin ng Diyos na Kanyang ilalahad, kabilang ang paghatol at pagtubos; mahalaga kung sino ang makapagbubukas nito.'],
      ['An elder tells John not to weep: the Lion of the tribe of Judah, the Root of David, has conquered. John then sees a Lamb standing as though slain. Jesus conquered through his sacrifice; though slain, he lives. He takes the scroll from the hand of the One on the throne. What no one else could do, he is worthy to do.', 'Sinabi ng isang matanda kay Juan na huwag nang umiyak: nagtagumpay ang Leon mula sa lipi ni Juda, ang Ugat ni David. Pagkatapos ay nakita ni Juan ang isang Korderong nakatayo na para bang pinatay. Nagtagumpay si Jesus sa pamamagitan ng Kanyang sakripisyo; bagaman pinatay, Siya ay buhay. Kinuha Niya ang balumbon mula sa kamay ng nakaupo sa trono. Ang hindi kayang gawin ng iba ay karapat-dapat Niyang gawin.']
    ], verse: ['Revelation 5:5–6', 'The Lion has conquered; John sees a Lamb standing, as though slain.', 'Nagtagumpay ang Leon; nakita ni Juan ang isang Korderong nakatayo na para bang pinatay.'], question: ['Why does the vision describe Jesus as both the conquering Lion and the Lamb who was slain? What does his victory teach us about him?', 'Bakit inilalarawan ng pangitain si Jesus bilang nagtagumpay na Leon at bilang Korderong pinatay? Ano ang itinuturo ng Kanyang tagumpay tungkol sa Kanya?']
  },
  {
    number: '04', title: 'Trust the One who gave himself for us', filTitle: 'Magtiwala sa Nagbigay ng Kanyang sarili para sa atin',
    paragraphs: [
      ['The new song declares why the Lamb is worthy: he was slain and by his blood ransomed people for God from every tribe, language, people, and nation. He made them a kingdom and priests to serve God. Our hope rests in what Jesus has done, not in our ability to make ourselves worthy.', 'Ipinapahayag ng bagong awit kung bakit karapat-dapat ang Kordero: Siya ay pinatay at sa pamamagitan ng Kanyang dugo ay tinubos ang mga tao para sa Diyos mula sa bawat lipi, wika, bayan, at bansa. Ginawa Niya silang isang kaharian at mga pari upang maglingkod sa Diyos. Ang ating pag-asa ay nasa ginawa ni Jesus, hindi sa kakayahan nating gawing karapat-dapat ang sarili.'],
      ['Money, strength, appearance, institutions, and even people we love cannot carry the full weight of our faith. These gifts and relationships matter, but they can change or fail us. Jesus alone is worthy of our complete trust. Faith is more than saying we believe: let us surrender our lives to him and follow his authority.', 'Hindi kayang pasanin ng pera, lakas, itsura, institusyon, o maging ng mga mahal natin ang buong bigat ng ating pananampalataya. Mahalaga ang mga kaloob at relasyong ito, ngunit maaari silang magbago o magkulang. Si Jesus lamang ang karapat-dapat sa buo nating pagtitiwala. Higit sa pagsasabing naniniwala tayo ang pananampalataya: isuko natin ang ating buhay sa Kanya at sumunod sa Kanyang pamamahala.']
    ], question: ['Where are we relying on something that cannot bear the weight of our trust? What would surrender to Jesus look like there this week?', 'Saan tayo umaasa sa bagay na hindi kayang pasanin ang bigat ng ating pagtitiwala? Ano ang magiging hitsura ng pagsuko kay Jesus sa bahaging iyon ngayong linggo?']
  },
  {
    number: '05', title: 'Bring our prayers and worship', filTitle: 'Dalhin ang ating mga panalangin at pagsamba',
    paragraphs: [
      ['When the Lamb takes the scroll, the living creatures and elders fall before him. The golden bowls of incense are the prayers of the saints. This picture encourages us to pray: through faith in Jesus, let us bring our needs, our families, and our world before God. We can depend on him as we seek his will.', 'Nang kunin ng Kordero ang balumbon, nagpatirapa sa harap Niya ang mga nilalang at ang matatanda. Ang gintong mga mangkok ng insenso ay ang mga panalangin ng mga banal. Pinapalakas ng larawang ito ang loob nating manalangin: sa pananampalataya kay Jesus, dalhin natin sa Diyos ang ating pangangailangan, pamilya, at mundo. Maaari tayong umasa sa Kanya habang hinahanap natin ang Kanyang kalooban.'],
      ['The song of heaven grows from the creatures and elders to countless angels and every creature. Blessing, honor, glory, and might belong to the One on the throne and to the Lamb. Our worship joins this confession: no one else is worthy of our trust and worship. Whatever we face, let us turn our hearts to him.', 'Mula sa mga nilalang at matatanda, lumawak ang awit sa napakaraming anghel at sa lahat ng nilikha. Ang pagpapala, karangalan, kaluwalhatian, at kapangyarihan ay sa nakaupo sa trono at sa Kordero. Nakikiisa ang ating pagsamba sa pagpapahayag na ito: wala nang iba pang karapat-dapat sa ating pagtitiwala at pagsamba. Anuman ang ating harapin, ibaling natin ang ating puso sa Kanya.']
    ], verse: ['Revelation 5:12', 'The Lamb who was slain is worthy to receive power, wisdom, honor, glory, and blessing.', 'Karapat-dapat ang Korderong pinatay na tumanggap ng kapangyarihan, karunungan, karangalan, kaluwalhatian, at pagpapala.'], question: ['How does knowing that God receives the prayers of his people encourage us to pray and worship together?', 'Paano tayo hinihikayat na manalangin at sumamba nang magkakasama kapag alam nating tinatanggap ng Diyos ang mga panalangin ng Kanyang bayan?']
  }
];
const translations: Record<string, string> = {
 languageLabel:'Wika', languageAriaLabel:'Wika ng pagbabasa', navAria:'Pangunahing navigation', homeAria:'Bumalik sa DMI Calamba City home', summaryAria:'Buod ng Bible study', takeawayAria:'Pangunahing takeaway ng Bible study', coverLinkAria:'Simulan ang The One Who Is Worthy Bible study', coverImageAlt:'Unang Canva slide ng Until He Comes: pamagat ng Revelation series sa madilim na background', qrLinkAria:'Buksan ang Bible study na ito', qrImageAlt:'QR code para sa The One Who Is Worthy Bible study',
 eyebrow:'Bible Study · Pahayag 4–5', title:'The One Who Is Worthy', subtitle:'Magtiwala at sumamba sa Korderong nagtagumpay', hero:'Karapat-dapat ang Korderong pinatay na tumanggap ng kapangyarihan at kaluwalhatian.', heroCitation:'Pahayag 5:12 · salin para sa study', themeLabel:'Tema', theme:'Nananatili ang Diyos sa Kanyang trono. Si Jesus, ang Korderong pinatay at buhay, ay karapat-dapat sa buo nating pagtitiwala at pagsamba.', keyLabel:'Mga susing talata', key:'Pahayag 4:1–11 · Ang trono<br />Pahayag 5:1–14 · Ang Kordero at ang balumbon', timeLabel:'Oras', time:'35–40 minuto', presentation:'Presentation', presentationLink:'Buksan sa Canva <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>', service:'Sunday service', serviceLink:'Panoorin ang pangangaral sa YouTube <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>', serviceTime:'Bahagi ng sermon: 00:59:50–01:52:50', facebook:'Facebook Live', facebookLink:'Panoorin sa Facebook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>', discuss:'Pag-usapan', responseSection:'06 · Isabuhay ang narinig', responseTitle:'Magtiwala, manalangin, at sumamba', responseIntro:'Pumili ng isang hakbang ngayong linggo at gawin ito kasama ang isang kapatid kay Cristo.', respond:'Tumugon', step1:'Basahin ang Pahayag 4–5. Itala kung sino ang sinasamba, bakit Siya karapat-dapat, at paano tumutugon ang mga nasa paligid ng trono.', step2:'Pangalanan sa panalangin ang isang takot o pinagkakatiwalaan mong humalili kay Jesus. Isuko ito sa Kanya at pumili ng isang konkretong pagsunod.', step3:'Manalangin kasama ang isang kapatid para sa inyong mga pamilya at pangangailangan. Maglaan din ng oras upang purihin ang Diyos sa Kanyang kabanalan at ang Kordero sa Kanyang pagtubos.', promiseLabel:'Dalhin sa linggong ito', promise:'Ang Diyos ay nasa Kanyang trono. Si Jesus ay karapat-dapat sa ating pagtitiwala at pagsamba.', prayerSection:'07 · Manalangin', prayerTitle:'Panginoon, sa Iyo kami nagtitiwala', prayer1:'Panginoong Diyos, salamat dahil Ikaw ay banal at makapangyarihan. Sa gitna ng pagbabago at mga problemang hindi namin kayang lutasin, nananatili Kang naghahari. Dinadala namin sa Iyo ang aming mga takot at pangangailangan.', prayer2:'Panginoong Jesus, salamat dahil ibinigay Mo ang Iyong buhay upang kami ay tubusin. Ikaw ang Korderong pinatay at ngayon ay buhay. Patawarin Mo kami sa paglalagay ng aming lubos na tiwala sa ibang bagay. Isinusuko namin sa Iyo ang aming buhay; turuan Mo kaming sumunod.', prayer3:'Banal na Espiritu, kumilos Ka sa amin. Palakasin Mo kaming manalangin, magtiwala, at sumamba kasama ang Iyong bayan. Sa Iyo ang karangalan at kaluwalhatian magpakailanman. Amen.', takeawayLabel:'Dalhin mo ito', takeaway:'Wala nang iba pang karapat-dapat sa ating buong pagtitiwala at pagsamba. Ang Diyos ay naghahari, at si Jesus ang Korderong nagtagumpay para sa atin.', shareLabel:'Ibahagi ang study', shareTitle:'Buksan sa ibang device', shareBody:'I-scan o i-download ang QR code para direktang makabalik sa Bible study na ito.', downloadQr:'I-download ang QR code', scriptureNotice:'Ang mga Scripture quotation sa pahinang ito ay mga malayang salin para sa study. Basahin ang buong Pahayag 4–5 sa inyong Bibliya.', footerTagline:'Nagkakatipon kay Jesus. Hinuhubog ng Kanyang Salita.'
};
sections.forEach((section, i) => {
 translations[`section${i}Title`] = section.filTitle;
 section.paragraphs.forEach((paragraph, j) => translations[`section${i}Body${j}`] = paragraph[1]);
 translations[`section${i}Question`] = section.question[1];
 if (section.verse) { translations[`section${i}Verse`] = section.verse[2]; translations[`section${i}Citation`] = `${section.verse[0].replace('Revelation', 'Pahayag')} · salin para sa study`; }
});
---
<BaseLayout title="The One Who Is Worthy: Revelation 4–5 | DMI Calamba City" description="A Bible study on God’s throne and the Lamb who is worthy of our trust and worship." bodyClass="study-page" socialImage={cover} socialImageAlt="Until He Comes Canva presentation cover with the Revelation series title on a dark background" socialImageWidth={2400} socialImageHeight={1350}>
  <a class="study-cover" href="#study" aria-label="Begin The One Who Is Worthy Bible study" data-i18n-aria-label="coverLinkAria"><picture><source srcset={`${base}${slug}-cover-1280.webp 1280w, ${base}${slug}-cover-2400.webp 2400w`} sizes="100vw" type="image/webp" /><img src={cover} width="2400" height="1350" alt="Until He Comes Canva presentation cover with the Revelation series title on a dark background" data-i18n-alt="coverImageAlt" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" /></picture></a>
  <header class="study-hero" id="study"><nav class="study-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation" data-i18n-aria-label="navAria"><a class="brand-lockup" href={base} aria-label="Return to DMI Calamba City home" data-i18n-aria-label="homeAria"><img src={`${base}dmi-logo.jpg`} width="900" height="900" alt="" /><span>DMI · Calamba City</span></a><LanguageToggle translations={translations} /><span>1 November 2026</span></nav>
    <div class="study-hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="eyebrow">Bible Study · Revelation 4–5</p><h1 data-i18n="title">The One Who Is Worthy</h1><p class="study-subtitle" data-i18n="subtitle">Trust and worship the Lamb who has conquered</p></div>
    <blockquote class="hero-scripture"><p lang="en" data-i18n="hero" data-i18n-lang>The Lamb who was slain is worthy to receive power and glory.</p><cite lang="en" data-i18n="heroCitation" data-i18n-lang>Revelation 5:12 · study paraphrase</cite></blockquote>
  </header>
  <main class="study-content"><aside class="study-aside" aria-label="Study summary" data-i18n-aria-label="summaryAria">
    <div><span class="aside-label" data-i18n="themeLabel">Theme</span><p data-i18n="theme">God remains on his throne. Jesus, the Lamb who was slain and lives, is worthy of our complete trust and worship.</p></div>
    <div><span class="aside-label" data-i18n="keyLabel">Key texts</span><p data-i18n="key">Revelation 4:1–11 · The throne<br />Revelation 5:1–14 · The Lamb and the scroll</p></div>
    <div><span class="aside-label" data-i18n="timeLabel">Time</span><p data-i18n="time">35–40 minutes</p></div>
    <div><span class="aside-label" data-i18n="presentation">Presentation</span><a class="aside-action" href="https://canva.link/qzxlvi20z7g1ddv" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-i18n="presentationLink">Open in Canva <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div><span class="aside-label" data-i18n="service">Sunday service</span><a class="aside-action" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uhSO8W6zxTk&amp;t=3590" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-i18n="serviceLink">Watch the preaching on YouTube <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p data-i18n="serviceTime">Sermon segment: 00:59:50–01:52:50</p></div>
    <div><span class="aside-label" data-i18n="facebook">Facebook Live</span><a class="aside-action" href="https://www.facebook.com/share/v/19fRWbV91j/?mibextid=wwXIfr" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" data-i18n="facebookLink">Watch on Facebook <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  </aside><article class="study-article">
    {sections.map((section, i) => <section aria-labelledby={`section-${i}`}><p class="section-number">{section.number}</p><h2 id={`section-${i}`} data-i18n={`section${i}Title`}>{section.title}</h2>{section.paragraphs.map((paragraph, j) => <p data-i18n={`section${i}Body${j}`}>{paragraph[0]}</p>)}{section.verse && <blockquote class="verse-card"><p lang="en" data-i18n={`section${i}Verse`} data-i18n-lang>{section.verse[1]}</p><cite lang="en" data-i18n={`section${i}Citation`} data-i18n-lang>{section.verse[0]} · study paraphrase</cite></blockquote>}<div class="discussion-prompt"><span data-i18n="discuss">Discuss</span><p data-i18n={`section${i}Question`}>{section.question[0]}</p></div></section>)}
    <section class="response-section" aria-labelledby="response-title"><p class="section-number" data-i18n="responseSection">06 · Put what you heard into practice</p><h2 id="response-title" data-i18n="responseTitle">Trust, pray, and worship</h2><p data-i18n="responseIntro">Choose one step this week and take it with a fellow believer.</p><ol class="response-steps"><li><span data-i18n="respond">Respond</span><p data-i18n="step1">Read Revelation 4–5. Note who is worshiped, why he is worthy, and how those around the throne respond.</p></li><li><span data-i18n="respond">Respond</span><p data-i18n="step2">Name in prayer one fear or source of confidence that has taken Jesus’ place. Surrender it to him and choose one concrete act of obedience.</p></li><li><span data-i18n="respond">Respond</span><p data-i18n="step3">Pray with another believer for your families and needs. Also take time to praise God for his holiness and the Lamb for his redemption.</p></li></ol><div class="key-statement dark"><span data-i18n="promiseLabel">Carry into the week</span><p data-i18n="promise">God is on his throne. Jesus is worthy of our trust and worship.</p></div></section>
    <section class="closing-prayer" aria-labelledby="prayer-title"><p class="section-number" data-i18n="prayerSection">07 · Pray</p><h2 id="prayer-title" data-i18n="prayerTitle">Lord, we trust in You</h2><p data-i18n="prayer1">Lord God, thank You for Your holiness and power. Amid change and problems we cannot solve, You remain on the throne. We bring You our fears and needs.</p><p data-i18n="prayer2">Lord Jesus, thank You for giving Your life to redeem us. You are the Lamb who was slain and now lives. Forgive us for placing our complete trust elsewhere. We surrender our lives to You; teach us to obey.</p><p data-i18n="prayer3">Holy Spirit, work in us. Strengthen us to pray, trust, and worship together with Your people. Honor and glory belong to You forever. Amen.</p></section>
    <section class="takeaway" aria-label="Study takeaway" data-i18n-aria-label="takeawayAria"><span data-i18n="takeawayLabel">Take this with you</span><p data-i18n="takeaway">No one else is worthy of our complete trust and worship. God reigns, and Jesus is the Lamb who conquered for us.</p></section>
    <section class="qr-section" aria-labelledby="share-title"><div><p class="section-number" data-i18n="shareLabel">Share the study</p><h2 id="share-title" data-i18n="shareTitle">Open on another device</h2><p data-i18n="shareBody">Scan or download this QR code to return directly to this Bible study.</p><a class="text-link" href={qr} download="dmi-the-one-who-is-worthy-qr.png" data-i18n="downloadQr">Download QR code</a></div><a class="qr-card" href={pageURL} aria-label="Open this Bible study" data-i18n-aria-label="qrLinkAria"><img src={qr} width="720" height="720" alt="QR code for The One Who Is Worthy Bible study" data-i18n-alt="qrImageAlt" /></a></section>
    <p class="scripture-notice" lang="en" data-i18n="scriptureNotice" data-i18n-lang>Scripture excerpts on this page are study paraphrases. Read the whole of Revelation 4–5 in your Bible.</p>
  </article></main><footer class="site-footer"><a href={base}>DMI Calamba City</a><div class="site-footer-actions"><span data-i18n="footerTagline">Gathered around Jesus. Formed by his Word.</span><SocialLinks /></div></footer>
</BaseLayout>
